e Poker Championship in Bratislava this August!\\nHuge value with guaranteed live packages to win!\",\n            \"title\": \"Poker SM\"\n        },\n        \"virtualMTTPredictor\": {\n            \"subTitle\": \"\",\n            \"title\": \"MTT Predictor\"\n        },\n        \"virtualPhasedMTT\": {\n            \"subTitle\": \"Play \\u20ac5 buy-in Phase 1 to qualify to \\u20ac10,000 Phase 2\",\n            \"title\": \"Weekly Phase Cups\"\n        },\n        \"virtualSeriesMTT\": {\n            \"subTitle\": \"125 different tournaments, \\u20ac30,000 Main Event, \\u20ac7,300 Leaderboards\",\n            \"subTitleNonMonetary\": \"More than 90 tournaments with a \\u20ac40,000 main event\",\n            \"title\": \"Anniversary Bounty Series\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"mttSchedule\": {\n        \"legendView\": {\n            \"addon\": \"Addon\",\n            \"bounty\": \"Bounty\",\n            \"flips\": \"Flips\",\n            \"hyper\": \"Hyper Turbo\",\n            \"omaha\": \"Omaha\",\n            \"phased\": \"Phased\",\n            \"pinned\": \"Pinned Tournament\",\n            \"promo\": \"Promo\",\n            \"qualifier\": \"Qualifier\",\n            \"rebuy\": \"Re-buy\",\n            \"seats6\": \"6 seats\",\n            \"seats9\": \"9 seats\",\n            \"slow\": \"Slow\",\n            \"texas\": \"Texas Hold'em\",\n            \"turbo\": \"Turbo\",\n            \"twitch\": \"Twitch Stream\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"mttSpecificLobby\": {\n        \"openPhase2Lobby\": \"Open phase 2 lobby\",\n        \"showPhase1s\": \"Show Phase 1's\"\n    },\n    \"myProfile\": {\n        \"addNew\": \"Add new\",\n        \"bonusShop\": \"Bonus Shop\",\n        \"challenges\": \"Challenges\",\n        \"frontPage\": {\n            \"bonus\": \"Bonus\",\n            \"bonusExpirationInfo\": \"Expires in {days} days\",\n            \"bonusExpirationInfo2\": \"Expires in {0} days\",\n            \"bonusExpiresInLabel\": \"Expires in\",\n            \"bonusExpiresInLessDaysValue\": \"< {0} days\",\n            \"bonusExpiresInLessHoursValue\": \"< {0} h\",\n            \"bonusExpiresOnLabel\": \"Expires on\",\n            \"bonusNextPayout\": \"My Tickets\",\n            \"bonusNextPayout2\": \"Next payout: {0}\",\n            \"challengePoints\": \"Challenge Points\",\n            \"changeBackground\": \"Change Background\",\n            \"earnMoreChallengePointsNotice\": \"Earn more Challenge Points to get new Bonuses!\",\n            \"earnMoreLoyaltyPointsNotice\": \"Earn more XP to get new Bonuses!\",\n            \"flopsSeen\": \"Flops seen\",\n            \"loyaltyPoints\": \"Loyalty Points\",\n            \"noBonusNotice\": \"You have no Bonus at the moment.\",\n            \"thisMonth\": \"This month\",\n            \"thisWeek\": \"This week\",\n            \"today\": \"Today\",\n            \"upcomingBonuses\": \"Upcoming: {bonuses}\",\n            \"yesterday\": \"Yesterday\"\n        },\n        \"gameLab\": \"Game Lab\",\n        \"hallOfFame\": \"Hall of Fame\",\n        \"history\": \"History\",\n        \"leaderboards\": \"Leaderboards\",\n        \"loyalty\": \"Loyalty\",\n        \"missions\": \"Missions\",\n        \"myTickets\": \"My Tickets\",\n        \"playBonus\": {\n            \"cancelBonus\": \"CANCEL ACTIVE BONUS\",\n            \"confirmDialogue\": {\n                \"cancelBonus\": \"Are you sure you want to cancel bonus?\"\n            },\n            \"current\": \"Current\",\n            \"upcoming\": \"Upcoming\"\n        },\n        \"playthoughBonus\": \"Playthrough Bonus\",\n        \"profile\": \"Profile\",\n        \"tableBackgroundSelector\": {\n            \"changesSaved\": \"Changes saved\",\n            \"saveChangesButton\": \"Save changes\"\n        },\n        \"ticketList\": {\n            \"cash\": \"Cash\",\n            \"cashTickets\": \"Cash Tickets\",\n            \"complete\": \"Complete\",\n            \"expired\": \"Expired\",\n            \"expires\": \"Expires\",\n            \"expiresInHours\": \"Expires in {hours} hours\",\n            \"incomplete\": \"Incomplete\",\n            \"tournamentTickets\": \"Tournament Tickets\",\n            \"usedUp\": \"Used up\",\n            \"youHaveNoCashTickets\": \"You have no Cash Tickets at the moment.\",\n            \"youHaveNoTournamentTickets\": \"You have no Tournament Tickets at the moment.\"\n        },\n        \"ticketOverlay\": {\n            \"activeStatus\": \"*Tickets have a rolling 7 day expiry and remain active if used at least once per 7 day period.\",\n            \"clearedStatus\": \"Congratulations! The money has been added to your account.\",\n            \"expiredStatus\": \"Unfortunately, you didn't play enough hands in time to fulfill the playthrough requirements. The ticket expired.\",\n            \"expiredTTStatus\": \"Unfortunately, the ticket expired\",\n            \"firstRule\": \"See one flop using this ticket to reset to 6 days*\",\n            \"flopsLeft\": \"Flops left\",\n            \"flopsLeftWithNumber\": \"{0} Flops left\",\n            \"lowBalanceCreditBonusStatus\": \"Your ticket balance was too low to be used at tables and has been credited to your account as Bonus Points\",\n            \"lowBalanceStatus\": \"Your ticket balance was too low to be used at tables. The remaining balance has been credited to your account.\",\n            \"unusableStatus\": \"Unfortunately there is no money left on your ticket\",\n            \"unusableTTStatus\": \"This ticket was used\",\n            \"useInGames\": \"Use in any of these games:\",\n            \"useInTournaments\": \"You can use this ticket\\nin the following tournaments\",\n            \"viewAllTournaments\": \"View all tournaments\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"newLoyalty\": {\n        \"text\": {\n            \"experiencePointsAbbrev\": \"XP\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"newLoyaltyFullView\": {\n        \"infoPopup\": {\n            \"descriptionFull\": \"HOW IT WORKS\\n\\u2022\\u00a0\\u00a0You earn Bonus Points as you play, which can be exchanged to tickets and bonuses in the Bonus Shop.\\n\\u2022\\u00a0\\u00a0When you rank up to a higher level, your Bonus Points multiplier increases, and you start earning Bonus Points much faster.\\n\\u2022\\u00a0\\u00a0On the road towards new levels, you are also rewarded with mid-tier prizes like tickets, bonuses and further Bonus Points.\\n\\u2022\\u00a0\\u00a0Our game lab \\u2013 your one-stop-shop for interesting data and tips on how to improve your game \\u2013 is also tied to the levels, with new data and features being unlocked at every level.\\n\\u2022\\u00a0At the start of every quarter, your progress is reset, unless you\\u2019ve reached level 6 or higher, in which case you\\u2019ll keep your Bonus Points multiplier.\",\n            \"descriptionNonMonetary\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"label\": {\n            \"credits\": \"BONUS POINTS\",\n            \"currentLevel\": \"Current Level:\",\n            \"header\": \"PLAY POKER, EARN XP, GET REWARDED\",\n            \"headerBonusShop\": \"SPEND'EM\",\n            \"headerNoCaps\": \"Play poker, earn XP, get rewarded\",\n            \"headerNonMonetary\": \"Play Poker to unlock more features in Game Lab\",\n            \"headerPart2\": \"PLAY MORE TO PROGRESS EVEN FASTER\",\n            \"multiplierPrizeDescription\": \"{0}x points multiplier\",\n            \"nextLevel\": \"Next Level:\",\n            \"nextReset\": \"Next Reset:\",\n            \"optIn\": \"OPT IN\",\n            \"optInExplanationText\": \"To be included into Loyalty program, you have to opt in.\",\n            \"promotionsOptOut\": \"You have choosen to opt-out from Loyalty.\\nMore info is available on {c2}Your Account {c1}page on Unibet site.\",\n            \"quaterPoints\": \"XP this quarter:\",\n            \"thisQuarter\": \"this quarter\",\n            \"yearlyPoints\": \"XP this year:\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"newLoyaltyInfoPopup\": {\n        \"label\": {\n            \"enterShop\": \"ENTER SHOP\",\n            \"header\": \"LOYALTY\",\n            \"loyaltyBalance\": \"BONUS POINTS\",\n            \"loyaltyDetails\": \"LOYALTY DETAILS\"\n        },\n        \"text\": {\n            \"pointsToNextLevel\": \"{0} XP to next level\",\n            \"pointsToPrize\": \"{0} XP to {1}\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"newTicketGiftScene\": {\n        \"text\": {\n            \"subTitle\": \"FROM UNIBET\",\n            \"title\": \"Merry Christmas\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"notifications\": {\n        \"newAvatar\": \"You have unlocked a new avatar\",\n        \"newBackground\": \"You have unlocked a new table background\"\n    },\n    \"privacyFr\": {\n        \"mainSubView\": {\n            \"accept\": \"ACCEPT\",\n            \"continueWithoutAccept\": \"Continue without accept\",\n            \"description1\": \"Bienvenue sur Unibet Poker ! Nous utilisons des cookies en collaboration avec {c1}nos partenaires{d} lorsque vous parcourez notre application. Ces cookies nous permettent de la faire fonctionner et de vous fournir les services suivants :\\n\",\n            \"description2\": \"- Mesure d'audience et am\\u00e9lioration des contenus\\n- Personnalisation de l'exp\\u00e9rience Parions Sport en Ligne\\n- Optimisation de la publicit\\u00e9\\n- Adaptation des pushs\\n\",\n            \"description3\": \"Vous pouvez d\\u00e8s maintenant param\\u00e9trer vos cookies selon leur but, accepter ou refuser le d\\u00e9p\\u00f4t de l'ensemble des cookies. Un lien \\u00ab G\\u00e9rer mes cookies \\u00bb sur notre application vous permet \\u00e9galement de modifier vos choix \\u00e0 tout moment.\\n\",\n            \"description4\": \"Consulter la {c1}Charte Vie Priv\\u00e9e{d} d'Unibet Poker\",\n            \"header\": \"Privacy Consent\",\n            \"parameters\": \"PARAMETERS\",\n            \"title\": \"B\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficiez d'une exp\\u00e9rience Unibet Poker enrichie !\"\n        },\n        \"partnersList\": {\n            \"description\": \"Liste des soci\\u00e9t\\u00e9s utilisant des cookies et traceurs sur notre application.\",\n            \"header\": \"Partners List\",\n            \"subDescription\": \"Personnalisation et mesure de la publicit\\u00e9 :\"\n        },\n        \"privacyCenter\": {\n            \"acceptAll\": \"Accept all\",\n            \"confirmChoices\": \"Confirm Selection\",\n            \"description\": \"Si vous souhaitez b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficier de la meilleure exp\\u00e9rience {c1}Unibet{d}, vous pouvez accepter les cookies ci-dessous !\",\n            \"descriptionAbtest\": \"Ces cookies sont utilis\\u00e9s pour adapter le contenu de notre application selon vos parcours et vos attentes.\",\n            \"descriptionAudience\": \"Ces cookies sont utilis\\u00e9s pour mesurer l'audience de notre application et la performance de nos op\\u00e9rations marketing afin d'am\\u00e9liorer les contenus et services pour l'ensemble des utilisateurs.\",\n            \"descriptionBottom1\": \"Consulter la {c1}Charte Vie Privee{d} de Unibet\",\n            \"descriptionBottom2\": \"Consulter la Charte Vie Privee de {c1}nos partenairs\",\n            \"descriptionPartnership\": \"Ces cookies sont utilis\\u00e9s pour vous proposer des publicit\\u00e9s adapt\\u00e9es \\u00e0 vos centres d'int\\u00e9r\\u00eat sur des sites ou applications tiers, limiter le nombre de fois o\\u00f9 vous voyez une m\\u00eame annonce et garantir la s\\u00e9curit\\u00e9 de diffusion de nos annonces.\",\n            \"descriptionPush\": \"Ces cookies sont utilis\\u00e9s pour am\\u00e9liorer la pertinence des pushs notification sur nos sites et applications en fonction de votre parcours et de votre profil. Votre choix sur la personnalisation des Pushs sera pris en compte \\u00e0 partir de la prochaine ouverture de l'application.\",\n            \"descriptionServices\": \"Ces cookies sont strictement n\\u00e9cessaires au fonctionnement de nos sites et applications. Ils vous permettent de naviguer sur nos espaces digitaux et d'en utiliser les fonctionnalit\\u00e9s de fa\\u00e7on optimale et s\\u00e9curis\\u00e9e.\",\n            \"header\": \"G\\u00e9rer mes cookies\",\n            \"labelAbtest\": \"Personnalisation de l'exp\\u00e9rience\",\n            \"labelAlwaysActive\": \"Always Active\",\n            \"labelAudience\": \"Mesure d'audience et am\\u00e9lioration des contenus\",\n            \"labelIdentifier\": \"Votre identifiant de consentement :\",\n            \"labelIdentifierPush\": \"Votre identifiant pushs :\",\n            \"labelPartnership\": \"Optimisation de la publicit\\u00e9\",\n            \"labelPush\": \"Adaptation des pushs\",\n            \"labelServices\": \"Fonctionnement de nos services\",\n            \"rejectAll\": \"Reject all\"\n        },\n        \"privacyChart\": {\n            \"header\": \"Privacy Chart\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"promo\": {\n        \"bingo\": {\n            \"boardExpiredLabel\": \"Expired\",\n            \"eligibleGamesCashGame0\": \"Banzai \\u20ac1\",\n            \"eligibleGamesCashGame1\": \"Banzai \\u20ac5\",\n            \"eligibleGamesCashGame2\": \"Banzai \\u20ac20\",\n            \"eligibleGamesHexapro0\": \"\",\n            \"eligibleGamesHexapro1\": \"\",\n            \"eligibleGamesHexapro2\": \"\",\n            \"eligibleGamesLabelWithColon\": \"Eligible games:\",\n            \"eligibleGamesMtt0\": \"\",\n            \"eligibleGamesMtt1\": \"\",\n            \"eligibleGamesMtt2\": \"\",\n            \"label\": {\n                \"dailyCap\": \"Daily cap:\",\n                \"handsLeft\": \"Hands left:\",\n                \"history\": \"History\"\n            },\n            \"showGamesButtonLabel\": \"SHOW GAMES\",\n            \"subTitle\": \"Play Bingo with your Banzai cash game Poker hands! Every day during the promotion period you receive a Bingo grid upon login. Each grid has 3 patterns to complete. The pattern represents the hole cards to collect. Bingo grids expires after 40 hands and you can play up to 3 grids per day.\",\n            \"tiername0\": \"LOW\",\n            \"tiername1\": \"MID\",\n            \"tiername2\": \"HIGH\",\n            \"tiername3\": \"\",\n            \"title\": \"Banzai Bingo\"\n        },\n        \"hexapro21\": {\n            \"activePhaseInfoMessage\": \"Reach a total of 21 with your HexaPro multipliers! Each time you play an eligible HexaPro the multiplier value adds up on the progress bar and if you reach exactly 21 you will get a randomized token, from Bronze to Diamond. That token can then be used to play our Prize Wheel for fantastic prizes! New daily attempts throughout the promo period. \",\n            \"banner\": {\n                \"recentMultipliersLabel\": \"Recent multipliers:\"\n            },\n            \"dailyAttemptsLabel\": \"Active attempt:\",\n            \"dailyAttemptsNoMoreToday\": \"No more attempts today\",\n            \"eligibleGamesLabel\": \"ELIGIBLE GAMES\",\n            \"eligibleGamesValue\": \"Traditional HexaPro \\u20ac1 - \\u20ac100\",\n            \"playAgainInfoMessage\": \"Win on your multipliers!\\nEvery day you have a new chance of getting \\\"21\\\" in our new exciting HexaPro promotion!\",\n            \"rewardValue\": \"up to \\u20ac10 000!\",\n            \"title\": \"21\",\n            \"tokenReveal\": {\n                \"winTierName0\": \"BRONZE\",\n                \"winTierName1\": \"SILVER\",\n                \"winTierName2\": \"GOLD\",\n                \"winTierName3\": \"DIAMOND\"\n            },\n            \"tokensEarnedBronze\": \"Bronze tokens earned\",\n            \"tokensEarnedDiamond\": \"Diamond tokens earned\",\n            \"tokensEarnedGold\": \"Gold tokens earned\",\n            \"tokensEarnedSilver\": \"Silver tokens earned\"\n        },\n        \"highHand\": {\n            \"HoldEm\": {\n                \"banzai\": \"Banzai\",\n                \"fast\": \"\",\n                \"trad\": \"No Limit Texas Hold'em\"\n            },\n            \"Omaha\": {\n                \"banzai\": \"\",\n                \"fast\": \"\",\n                \"trad\": \"Pot Limit Omaha\"\n            },\n            \"currentBestHands\": \"Current best hands:\",\n            \"currentLeader\": \"Current leader\",\n            \"currentLeaderWithColon\": \"Current leader:\",\n            \"description\": \"100 Big blinds worth ticket to be won if you get the highest hand!\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Make the best hand during the period to win the prize! All cash game pools are eligible for High hand promotion except NL4/PL4, the Banzai cash games NL1 PARK and NL50 MASTER TEMPLE.\",\n            \"nextPrizeIn\": \"Next prize in:\",\n            \"startsAgainAt\": \"Promotion starts again in\",\n            \"title\": \"High Hand\"\n        },\n        \"launchPromo\": {\n            \"bronze\": \"Bronze Tickets\",\n            \"bronzeWin\": \"Congratulations, you have been dealt into our Around the World table. The player on the button has won a Bronze raffle ticket. All other players at this table will receive a \\u20ac2 UO qualifier ticket!\",\n            \"gold\": \"Gold Tickets\",\n            \"goldStakes\": \"Gold Tickets are only dropped at NL/PL25 tables and above\",\n            \"goldWin\": \"Congratulations, you have been dealt into our Around the World table. The player on the button has won a Gold raffle ticket. All other players at this table will receive a \\u20ac10 UO qualifier ticket!\",\n            \"leftToBeDropped\": \"Dropped today:\",\n            \"leftToBeDroppedToday\": \"Dropped today:\",\n            \"silver\": \"Silver Tickets\",\n            \"silverStakes\": \"Silver Tickets are only dropped at NL/PL10 tables and above\",\n            \"silverWin\": \"Congratulations, you have been dealt into our Around the World table. The player on the button has won a Silver raffle ticket. All other players at this table will receive a \\u20ac10 UO qualifier ticket!\",\n            \"ticketsYouWon\": \"Tickets you won:\",\n            \"title\": \"Around the World\"\n        },\n        \"prizeDrop\": {\n            \"prize\": \"Prize\",\n            \"stakes\": \"At\",\n            \"stakesOver\": \"Come back tomorrow for new prizes\",\n            \"tableDropDescription\": \"Congratulations, you have been dealt into our Prize Drop table. The game is paused and will resume shortly. All players at the table will win a prize.\",\n            \"tableDropWinPopupDescription\": \"Congratulations! You won! {0}\",\n            \"title\": \"Prize Drop\",\n            \"winsLeft\": \"{0} winning tables left today\",\n            \"winsOver\": \"All prizes have been dropped\"\n        },\n        \"prizeDropPopup\": {\n            \"eligibleGames\": \"Eligible games:\",\n            \"explanation\": \"To win a prize, you need to be dealt in at a eligible cash game table which is randomly selected for a Prize Drop. All players dealt in at that table will automatically win the same prize. Prize drops happening between 12:00 UTC - 23:59 UTC. \",\n            \"progressInfoTemplate\": \"{0} prizes dropped today\",\n            \"tierName0\": \"Bronze\",\n            \"tierName1\": \"Silver\",\n            \"tierName2\": \"Gold\"\n        },\n        \"ragsToRiches\": {\n            \"activePhaseInfoMessage\": \"A flop with rags is a flop with one or more card(s) under 6 (2, 3, 4, 5). Max 3 tokens per day.\\nEligible cash games (incl. all Cash Game Banzai): \\u20ac4 - \\u20ac25 NL/PL.\\nEligible HexaPro games (incl. HexaPro Banzai): Buy-in \\u20ac1 - \\u20ac25.\",\n            \"gameTableType0\": \"Cash game flops seen with rags\",\n            \"gameTableType2\": \"SNG played\",\n            \"gameTableType3\": \"HexaPro played with 2x multiplier\",\n            \"title\": \"Rags To Riches\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"promoOverview\": {\n        \"title\": \"Promo overview\"\n    },\n    \"promoPackage\": {\n        \"anniversary2024\": {\n            \"overlayView\": {\n                \"anniversar