icket\",\n                    \"3881\": \"20 Cash Spins on Money Train 2\",\n                    \"3882\": \"5x Santa Flip Tokens\",\n                    \"3883\": \"\\u20ac500 CASH FLIP (50 players win \\u20ac10 cash)\",\n                    \"3884\": \"\\u20ac1 Banzai Ticket\",\n                    \"3885\": \"20 Cash-Spins on Wild Chapo 2\",\n                    \"3886\": \"5x Santa Flip Tokens\",\n                    \"3887\": \"3 x \\u20ac0,2 HexaPro Tickets\",\n                    \"3888\": \"30 Cash-Spins on Money Train\",\n                    \"3889\": \"\\u20ac1,000 NYE Cash Flip Ticket\",\n                    \"3890\": \"\\u20ac500 Freeroll ticket\",\n                    \"3891\": \"200 Bonus Points\",\n                    \"3892\": \"\\u20ac2 HexaPro ticket\",\n                    \"3893\": \"\\u20ac1000 Freeroll ticket\",\n                    \"3894\": \"\\u20ac5 HexaPro ticket\",\n                    \"3895\": \"\\u20ac10 HexaPro ticket\",\n                    \"3896\": \"\\u20ac2,000 Weekly Grind Special ticket\",\n                    \"3897\": \"\\u20ac2,000 Weekly Grind Special ticket\",\n                    \"3898\": \"\\u20ac2,000 Weekly Grind Special ticket\",\n                    \"3899\": \"\\u20ac2,000 Weekly Grind Special ticket\",\n                    \"3900\": \"\\u20ac3,000 VALENTINE'S MISSION SPECIAL TICKET\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"step\": {\n                \"desc\": {\n                    \"1001\": \"Visit the achievements page by going to \\\"View Profile\\\" then \\\"Achievements\\\"\",\n                    \"1002\": \"Change your identity by going to \\\"View Profile\\\" then \\\"Create New Identity\\\"\",\n                    \"1003\": \"Go to Settings and change your table background\",\n                    \"1004\": \"From the main lobby, select \\\"Cash Game\\\" then join any game and reach the flop 10 times\",\n                    \"1005\": \"In the main lobby, choose \\\"Cash Game\\\" then choose Fast Hold'em, select a stake, then press the \\\"Join\\\" button. Reach the flop ten times to complete this objective.\",\n                    \"1006\": \"In the main lobby, choose \\\"Sit & Go\\\" then choose either 2 or 5 seats, select a stake then press the \\\"Join\\\" button. Finish the Sit & Go to complete this objective.\",\n                    \"1007\": \"In the main lobby, choose \\\"Tournament\\\", then \\\"Full Schedule\\\". Filter to Unibet Open satellites by using the \\\"Unibet Open\\\" checkbox. Register for a satellite and finish it to complete this objective.\",\n                    \"1008\": \"From the main lobby, select \\\"Cash Game\\\", then join any game and turn on \\\"Play in Cents\\\" setting from the top right option menu\",\n                    \"1009\": \"Learn about Challenges by going to My Profile in the footer (icon down in the right bottom corner)\",\n                    \"1010\": \"Complete three minor steps in Challenges that earn at least {0} loyalty points each\",\n                    \"1011\": \"Complete one major step in Challenges that earns at least {0} loyalty points\",\n                    \"1012\": \"Complete two major steps in Challenges that earn at least {0} loyalty points each\",\n                    \"1013\": \"Complete one minor step in Challenges\",\n                    \"1014\": \"In the main lobby, choose \\\"Cash Game\\\", \\\"Omaha\\\", \\\"PL4 (\\u20ac0.02/\\u20ac0.04)\\\" then click \\\"Join\\\", then see ten flops\",\n                    \"1015\": \"Turn on \\\"4-colour Deck\\\" setting from the top right option menu\",\n                    \"1016\": \"Change your table background by going to \\\"View Profile\\\", \\\"Change Background\\\" and choose the horse racetrack background\",\n                    \"1017\": \"Go to Tournaments and click on the Filters icon\",\n                    \"1018\": \"From the main lobby, choose \\\"Sit & Go\\\" then choose \\\"2 Seat\\\", then finish a Sit & Go\",\n                    \"1019\": \"Play a \\u20ac4 or more Tournament\",\n                    \"1020\": \"Reach 200 big blinds (double the maximum allowed starting stack) in a cash game at any point\",\n                    \"1021\": \"See a flop in any cash game 3 days in a row\",\n                    \"1022\": \"See a flop in Fast Hold'em 3 days in a row\",\n                    \"1023\": \"Play at least one Sit & Go for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1024\": \"Complete a tournament 3 days in a row\",\n                    \"1025\": \"Get AA as hole cards in a NLHE cash game (incl. Banzai) {0} times\",\n                    \"1026\": \"Play a \\u20ac1 Sit & Go\",\n                    \"1027\": \"You will only be rewarded for completing the first \\\"Be dealt aces 15 times\\\" mission\",\n                    \"1028\": \"You will only be rewarded for completing the first \\\"Be dealt aces 15 times\\\" mission\",\n                    \"1030\": \"Turn on \\\"Table Prioritisation\\\" setting from the top right option menu\",\n                    \"1031\": \"Complete a tournament with \\\"9 Seat\\\" in the name on one day\",\n                    \"1032\": \"See 10 flops at any NLHE stake on a different day\",\n                    \"1033\": \"Play any non-freeroll multi-table tournament with the word \\\"Ante\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1034\": \"See 10 flops at any PLO stake on a different day\",\n                    \"1035\": \"Complete a qualifier to the Saturday Stack on one day\",\n                    \"1036\": \"See 10 flops at Fast Hold'em 10 on a different day\",\n                    \"1037\": \"Complete a minor Challenge\",\n                    \"1038\": \"See 10 flops at Fast Hold'em 25 one day\",\n                    \"1039\": \"Complete a tournament with \\\"Deep\\\" in the name on another day\",\n                    \"1040\": \"See 10 flops at any PLO stake and 10 flops at any NLHE stake within an hour (Banzai excluded) \",\n                    \"1042\": \"Change your table background by going to \\\"View Profile\\\", \\\"Change Background\\\" and choose the London background\",\n                    \"1043\": \"See the required number of flops in cash games to earn 3 spins for the Unibet Open Slot\",\n                    \"1044\": \"Complete a non-freeroll Unibet Open qualifier on a different day\",\n                    \"1045\": \"Complete a Major Challenge that earns between {0} and {1} loyalty points\",\n                    \"1046\": \"Complete a Major Challenge that earns between {0} and {1} loyalty points\",\n                    \"1047\": \"Reach 200 big blinds (double the maximum allowed starting stack) in a Fast Hold'em at any point\",\n                    \"1049\": \"Change your table background by going to \\\"View Profile\\\", \\\"Change Background\\\" and choose the landscape background\",\n                    \"1050\": \"Reach the flop in at least one cash game hand where only 2-3 players are dealt in\",\n                    \"1051\": \"Open at least two tables of any kind, then enable Table Tiling from the icons at the top of the table\",\n                    \"1052\": \"Open at least two tables of any kind, then enable Cascade from the icons at the top of the table\",\n                    \"1053\": \"Play at least one 2 seat SNG for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1054\": \"Play at least one 5 seat SNG for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1055\": \"See at least 10 flops on a single Saturday or Sunday\",\n                    \"1056\": \"Play any multi-table tournament that has a \\u20ac1 buy-in or higher for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1057\": \"Complete two minor NLHE Challenges in three days worth an average of at least {0} points each\",\n                    \"1058\": \"OR Complete two minor NLHE Challenges in three days worth an average of at least {0} points each\",\n                    \"1059\": \"OR Complete two minor PLO Challenges in three days worth an average of at least {0} points each\",\n                    \"1060\": \"Pressing on an objective will give you further information on how to complete it\",\n                    \"1061\": \"Join any NLHE cash game and reach the flop {0} times (Banzai excluded)\",\n                    \"1062\": \"Reach {0} flops at any Omaha stake\",\n                    \"1063\": \"Play at least one multi table tournament with a buy-in of \\u20ac{0} or more on at least three days in a row\",\n                    \"1064\": \"Visit Hand History by going to \\\"View Profile\\\" then \\\"Hand History\\\"\",\n                    \"1065\": \"From the main lobby, choose \\\"Sit & Go\\\" then choose \\\"5 Seat\\\", then finish a Sit & Go\",\n                    \"1066\": \"From the main lobby, click on Tournaments to see full view\",\n                    \"1067\": \"From the main lobby, choose \\\"Tournament\\\", then complete any tournament with a buy-in of \\u20ac1 or more that is not a Unibet Open satellite\",\n                    \"1068\": \"Play any non-freeroll multi-table-tournament with the phrase \\\"Unibet Open\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1069\": \"Play any multi-table Tournament that has a \\u20ac1 buy-in or higher\",\n                    \"1070\": \"From the main lobby, choose \\\"Cash Game\\\", join any game and win at least one hand\",\n                    \"1071\": \"Whilst playing an SNG, eliminate at least one player by winning the last of their chips\",\n                    \"1072\": \"On 15th December, be dealt a pair whilst playing at any table\",\n                    \"1073\": \"On 16th December, choose \\\"Cash Game\\\" from the main lobby and reach at least ten flops\",\n                    \"1074\": \"Create a new identity and use it\\n\\n\\n\",\n                    \"1075\": \"Play at least one 2 seat SNG for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1076\": \"Play any non-freeroll multi-table tournament with the word \\\"Qualifier\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1077\": \"At 19:00 CET on any day, play one of the multi-table-tournaments with \\\"Steps\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1078\": \"Play the \\\"\\u20ac1,500 GTD Daily 25\\\" tournament or play the \\\"\\u20ac1,000 GTD Daily 4\\\" tournament\",\n                    \"1079\": \"Play any non-freeroll multi-table tournament with the word \\\"Omaha\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1080\": \"Visit the Challenges history page by going to \\\"View Profile\\\" then \\\"Hand History\\\" then click on \\\"Challenges\\\"\",\n                    \"1081\": \"Reach 200 big blinds (double the maximum allowed starting stack) in an Omaha cash game, then do the same in Hold'em the next day\",\n                    \"1082\": \"Reach 200 big blinds (double the maximum allowed starting stack) in a Hold'em cash game, then do the same in Omaha the next day\",\n                    \"1083\": \"See at least 20 flops on a single Saturday or Sunday\",\n                    \"1084\": \"You will win a 100bb ticket for the stake you completed the most objectives in during those Challenges\",\n                    \"1085\": \"Change your appearance by creating a new identity\",\n                    \"1086\": \"In the main lobby, click on the Prize Drop icon to check today's prize. Then select \\\"Cash Game\\\", join any game and reach at least 5 flops.\",\n                    \"1087\": \"Play any multi-table tournament that has a \\u20ac1 buy-in or higher, then complete a Sit & Go the next day\",\n                    \"1088\": \"Complete a Sit and Go, then play any multi-table tournament that has a \\u20ac1 buy-in or higher the next day\",\n                    \"1089\": \"Join any Omaha cash game table and reach the flop 10 times. Then do the same in Hold'em the next day.\",\n                    \"1090\": \"Join any Hold'em cash game table and reach the flop 10 times. Then do the same in Omaha the next day.\",\n                    \"1091\": \"Play cash games to earn 3 spins for the Unibet Open Slot, then Complete a non-freeroll Unibet Open qualifier the next day\",\n                    \"1092\": \"Complete a Major Challenge that earns {0} loyalty points or more\",\n                    \"1094\": \"Play at least one Sit & Go tournament with a buy-in of \\u20ac{0} or more on at least 3 days in a row\",\n                    \"1095\": \"Reach {0} flops at any Banzai stake\",\n                    \"1096\": \"Play at least one multi table tournament with a buy-in of \\u20ac1 or more, then reach 10 flops at any Omaha stake the next day\",\n                    \"1097\": \"Play at least one 2 seat Sit & Go tournament, then play at least one 5 seat Sit & Go tournament the next day\",\n                    \"1098\": \"Be all-in in any Banzai cash game and reach a showdown\",\n                    \"1099\": \"Reach 20 big blinds (double the starting stack) in any Banzai cash game, then reach 5 flops at any Banzai stake the next day\",\n                    \"1100\": \"Reach {1} flops in any Banzai cash game on at least {0} days in a row\",\n                    \"1101\": \"Earn 2 achievements in the Summer Bootcamp promotion, then reach 5 flops in any Banzai cash game the next day\",\n                    \"1102\": \"Earn 3 achievements in the Summer Bootcamp promotion, then reach 10 flops in any PLO cash game the next day\",\n                    \"1103\": \"Complete the \\u20ac30 GTD Speed Omaha 9 Seat MTT at 18:15 UTC or play at least 3 x \\u20ac1 Sit & Go's\",\n                    \"1104\": \"Complete the \\u20ac250 GTD Hold'em 9 Seat MTT at 17:45 UTC or play at least 3 x \\u20ac4 Sit & Go's\",\n                    \"1105\": \"Complete the \\u20ac75 GTD Deep Crazy Hold'em MTT at 18:15 UTC or play at least 2 x \\u20ac10 or more Sit & Go's\",\n                    \"1106\": \"Earn 2 achievements in the Summer Bootcamp promotion\",\n                    \"1107\": \"In the main lobby, click on the Prize Drop icon to check today's prize. Then select \\\"Cash Game\\\", join any game and reach at least 5 flops.\",\n                    \"1108\": \"Complete a non-freeroll Unibet Open qualifier, then complete a Sit & Go the next day\",\n                    \"1109\": \"Play any multi-table Tournament that has a \\u20ac4 buy-in or higher for three days in a row\",\n                    \"1110\": \"Play any non-freeroll multi-table-tournament with the word \\\"Crazy\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1111\": \"Reach {1} flops at any Omaha stake on at least three days in a row\",\n                    \"1112\": \"Reach {1} cash game flops per day on {0} separate days\",\n                    \"1113\": \"From the main lobby, select \\\"Tournament\\\" then click the \\\"View Full Tournament Schedule\\\" button\",\n                    \"1114\": \"Play any multi-table tournament that has a buy-in of \\u20ac1 or higher with the word \\\"PKO\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1115\": \"Make a flush in Hold'em cash games {0} times (Banzai excluded)\",\n                    \"1116\": \"Make a flush in Omaha cash games {0} times\",\n                    \"1117\": \"Be eliminated from 3 non-freeroll multi-table tournaments with the word \\\"Shooting Star\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1118\": \"Be dealt {0} pocket pairs in Hold'em cash games (Banzai excluded)\",\n                    \"1119\": \"Be dealt 4 cards of the same suit in Omaha cash games\",\n                    \"1120\": \"Eliminate 3 players from any non-freeroll multi-table tournaments with the word \\\"Shooting Star\\\" in the name\",\n                    \"1121\": \"Play at least 5 cash game hands and receive a \\u20ac2 Unibet Open ticket\",\n                    \"1122\": \"Reach a flop with at least 4 other players in a Hold'em cash game (Banzai excluded)\",\n                    \"1123\": \"Be dealt 7-2 in any Hold'em cash game (Banzai excluded)\",\n                    \"1124\": \"Reach a flop with at least 4 other players in an